♪ If I didn't have you

3
00:00:05,185 --> 00:00:06,925
♪ Life would be blue

4
00:00:07,087 --> 00:00:10,067
♪ I'd be Doctor Who
without the TARDIS

5
00:00:10,223 --> 00:00:12,563
(Sheldon:)Is it me,
or does she not look so good?

6
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:16,170
♪ A candle without a wick
A Watson without a Crick

7
00:00:16,329 --> 00:00:19,209
♪ I'd be one of my outfits
